<title>ITALY: Italy stock futures soar to new record peak.</title>
<headline>Italy stock futures soar to new record peak.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Fib30 September futures contract on the Milan stock market hit a fresh record high of 21,030 moments after the opening, rising 0.8 percent on the day.</p>
<p>The index pulled back again within the first few minutes to stand 130 basis points up on the day at 21,000 by 0739 GMT.</p>
</text>
